    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yehooshaafaad Oo Ka Adkaaday Reer Moo'aab Iyo Reer Cammoon",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo taas dabadeedna waxaa Yehooshaafaad ku soo kacay inay la diriraan reer Moo'aab iyo reer Cammoon iyo qaar kale oo reer Cammoon ahaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa qaar yimid oo waxay Yehooshaafaad u soo sheegeen oo ku yidhaahdeen, Waxaa kugu soo socda col faro badan oo ka imanaya badda shishadeeda iyo dalka Suuriya, oo bal eeg haatan waxay joogaan Xasason Taamaar oo ah Ceyn Gedii. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kolkaasaa Yehooshaafaad cabsaday, oo wuxuu isu diyaariyey inuu Rabbiga doondoono, oo dalkii Yahuudah oo dhanna soon buu ku naadiyey. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasay dadkii Yahuudah oo dhammu iswada urursadeen inay Rabbiga caawimaad ka weyddiistaan, oo xataa magaalooyinkii dalka Yahuudah oo dhan way uga soo baxeen inay Rabbiga doondoonaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasa Yehooshaafaad isdhex taagay shirkii dadka Yahuudah iyo Yeruusaalem iyagoo jooga guriga Rabbiga iyo barxadda cusub horteeda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "oo wuxuu yidhi, Rabbiyow Ilaahii awowayaashayow, sow ma ahid Ilaaha samada ku jira? Oo sow ma ahid kan u taliya kulli boqortooyooyinka quruumaha oo dhan? Oo gacantaadana waxaa ku jira xoog iyo itaal oo sidaas daraaddeed ninna kuma hor istaagi karo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilaahayagow, dadkii dalkan degganaa sow kama aad eryin dadkaaga reer binu Israa'iil hortooda, oo weligiisba sow ma aadan siin saaxiibkaagii Ibraahim farcankiisii? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haddaba iyagu way dhex degganaan jireen, oo waxay magacaaga aawadiis uga dhex dhiseen meel quduus ah, oo waxay yidhaahdeen, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markii wax shar ahu ay nagu dhacaan hadday yihiin seef ama xukum ama belaayo ama abaar, annagu waxaan soo hor istaagi doonnaa gurigan iyo adiga, (waayo, magacaagu wuxuu ku jiraa gurigan), markaasaannu kuu qayshan doonnaa annagoo dhib ku jirna, oo adna waad na maqli doontaa oo waad na badbaadin doontaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haddaba bal eeg reer Cammoon iyo reer Moo'aab iyo reer Buur Seciir oo aad reer binu Israa'iil markay dalka Masar ka soo baxeen u diidday inay dalkooda galaan, laakiinse gees bay uga leexdeen oo mana ay baabbi'in. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bal eeg siday noogu abaal gudeen oo ay noogu soo baxeen iyagoo doonaya inay naga tuuraan hantidaadii aad dhaxal ahaan noo siisay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilaahayagow, miyaadan iyaga xukumi doonayn? Waayo, annagu itaal uma hayno guutadan weyn oo nagu soo socota, oo weliba wax aannu samaynona ma naqaan, laakiinse indhahayagu adigay kuu soo jeedaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo weliba dadka Yahuudah oo dhammu Rabbigay hor taagnaayeen iyaga iyo dhallaankoodii iyo naagahoodii iyo carruurtoodiiba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa ruuxii Rabbigu wuxuu ku soo degay Yaxasii'eel ina Sekaryaah, kaasoo ahaa ina Benaayaah, oo ahaa ina Yecii'eel, oo ahaa ina Matanyaah, oo reer Aasaaf ahaa, oo reer Laawi ka sii ahaa, isagoo shirka ku dhex jira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasuu yidhi, Kulligiin dadka Yahuudah, iyo kuwiinna Yeruusaalem deggan, iyo adiga Boqor Yehooshaafaad ahowba, wada maqla. Rabbigu wuxuu idinku leeyahay, Dadkan faraha badan daraaddiis ha u cabsanina, hana u qalbi jabina, waayo, dagaalka ma lihidin, laakiinse Ilaah baa iska leh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haddaba idinku berrito u dhaadhaca iyaga, oo bal eeg, waxay soo korayaan jiirta Siis, oo waxaad ka heli doontaan meesha dooxadu ku dhammaato oo ka horraysa cidlada Yeruu'eel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Idinku uma baahnaan doontaan inaad dagaalkan gashaan, haddaba dadkii Yahuudah iyo dadkii Yeruusaalemow, joogsada, oo iska taagnaada, oo eega badbaadada Rabbigu idin badbaadinayo; berrito iyaga u baxa, oo ha cabsanina, hana qalbi jabina, maxaa yeelay, Rabbiga ayaa idinla jira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa Yehooshaafaad madaxa foororshay oo wejiga dhulka saaray, oo dadkii Yahuudah iyo dadkii Yeruusaalem degganaa oo dhammuna Rabbiga hortiisay isku tuureen oo u sujuudeen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kolkaasaa kuwii reer Laawi oo ahaa reer Qohaad iyo reer Qorax waxay u istaageen inay Rabbiga ah Ilaaha reer binu Israa'iil cod aad iyo aad u weyn ku ammaanaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasay aroor hore kaceen oo waxay u ambabbaxeen xagga cidladii Teqooca, oo intay baxayeen ayaa Yehooshaafaad istaagay oo yidhi, Dadka Yahuudah iyo kuwiinna Yeruusaalem degganow, i maqla, rumaysta Rabbiga Ilaahiinna ah oo waad xoogaysan doontaan, oo rumaysta nebiyadiisa oo waad liibaani doontaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo markuu dadkii la tashaday ayuu doortay kuwii Rabbiga u gabyi lahaa oo ammaani lahaa iyagoo dhar quduus ah qaba oo ciidanka hor socda oo leh, Rabbiga ku mahad naqa, waayo, naxariistiisu weligeedba way waartaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo markay bilaabeen inay gabyaan oo Ilaah ammaanaan ayaa Rabbigu rag gaadmo ah ku soo kiciyey reer Cammoon iyo reer Moo'aab iyo reer Buur Seciir oo ku soo kacay dadkii Yahuudah, oo iyagii waa la laayay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waayo, reer Cammoon iyo reer Moo'aab ayaa is hortaageen dadkii degganaa Buur Seciir inay dhammaantood laayaan oo wada baabbi'iyaan, oo markay wada baabbi'iyeen dadkii Buur Seciir degganaa ayaa mid kastaaba kan kale ku caawiyey inuu nin kale dilo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo dadkii Yahuudah markay yimaadeen meeshii dheerayd ee cidlada ee wax laga dhawro ayay fiiriyeen dadkii faraha badnaa, oo waxay arkeen inay yihiin meydad dhulka ku dhacay, oo midna ma baxsan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Yehooshaafaad iyo dadkiisii markay u yimaadeen inay iyaga furtaan waxay dhexdoodii ka heleen maal badan oo meydadka la yaal iyo alaab qaali ah oo ay nafsaddooda u furteen, oo waxaasuna waxay qaadan karaan waa ka badnaayeen, oo intii saddex maalmood ah ayay dhicii guranayeen, maxaa yeelay, aad iyo aad buu u badnaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo maalintii afraad ayay ku shireen dooxada Barako, waayo, halkaasay Rabbiga ku ammaaneen, sidaas daraaddeed meeshaas magaceedii waxaa loo bixiyey Dooxadii Barako, oo ilaa maantadanna waa loo yaqaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa dadkii Yahuudah iyo dadkii Yeruusaalem oo dhammu iyagoo Yehooshaafaad u horreeyo waxay ku noqdeen Yeruusaalem iyagoo faraxsan, waayo, Rabbigu wuxuu kaga farxiyey libtii ay cadaawayaashoodii ka heleen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Yeruusaalem iyo gurigii Rabbiga ayay soo galeen iyagoo ka dhawaajinaya shareerado, iyo kataarado, iyo turumbooyin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo boqortooyooyinkii dalalka oo dhan waxaa ku soo degtay Ilaah cabsidiis markay maqleen in Rabbigu la diriray cadaawayaashii dadkii Israa'iil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sidaas daraaddeed Yehooshaafaad boqortooyadiisii way xasilloonayd, waayo, Ilaahiis ayaa ka nasiyey hareerihiisa oo dhan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Dhammaadkii Boqornimada Yehooshaafaad",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehooshaafaad boqor buu ka ahaa dalka Yahuudah, oo markuu boqor noqday wuxuu jiray shan iyo soddon sannadood, oo Yeruusaalemna shan iyo labaatan sannadood buu boqor ku ahaa, oo hooyadiis magaceedana waxaa la odhan jiray Casuubaah ina Shilxii. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo wuxuu ku socday jidkii aabbihiis Aasaa oo geesna ugama uu leexan, oo wixii Rabbiga hortiisa ku qummanaa ayuu sameeyey. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Habase yeeshee meelihii sarsare lama baabbi'in, oo dadkuna weli qalbigooda oo dhan ulama ay jeesan Ilaahii awowayaashood. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haddaba Yehooshaafaad falimihiisii kale, intii hore iyo intii dambeba, waxay ku qoran yihiin taariikhdii Yeehuu ina Xanaanii taasoo ku qoran kitaabkii boqorrada dalka Israa'iil.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
